WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.677 --> 00:00:12.123
Theo walked into the kitchen.

2
00:00:14.625 --> 00:00:15.766
His mom was cooking.

3
00:00:19.949 --> 00:00:20.609
for dinner?"

4
00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:21.570
he asked.

5
00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:25.793
"I'm making your favorite food," said Mom.

6
00:00:25.813 --> 00:00:29.976
"Macaroni and cheese."

7
00:00:33.656 --> 00:00:35.578
"Yum!" said Theo.

8
00:00:37.059 --> 00:00:39.741
Then he saw some spinach and carrots.

9
00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:45.846
said Theo.

10
00:00:47.648 --> 00:00:49.789
"What are those vegetables for?"

11
00:00:49.809 --> 00:00:54.073
"They're for a salad," said Mom.

12
00:00:54.093 --> 00:00:58.156
"It has salmon and vegetables."

13
00:00:58.176 --> 00:01:02.620
"Salmon!" cried Theo.

14
00:01:03.836 --> 00:01:04.897
"No, thanks.

15
00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:08.419
I'm just going to eat macaroni and cheese."

16
00:01:08.439 --> 00:01:13.083
"You can't eat just that," said Mom.

17
00:01:13.103 --> 00:01:18.426
"You need food from all five food groups."

18
00:01:22.289 --> 00:01:26.572
and cheese has stuff from two food groups," said Theo.

19
00:01:27.833 --> 00:01:32.356
"The macaroni is a grain, and the cheese is a dairy food.

20
00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:33.980
Isn't that enough?"

21
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.761
"You need vegetables too.

22
00:01:41.282 --> 00:01:44.143
Carrots have vitamin A," said Mom.

23
00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:47.004
She started chopping some carrots.

24
00:01:47.024 --> 00:01:50.685
"Vitamin A is good for your eyes."

25
00:01:55.206 --> 00:01:56.886
salmon good for us?"

26
00:01:57.427 --> 00:01:58.207
asked Theo.

27
00:01:58.227 --> 00:02:03.704
"Salmon is in the protein group," said Mom.

28
00:02:03.724 --> 00:02:08.486
"Protein helps build muscles."

29
00:02:14.369 --> 00:02:16.490
"Okay," said Theo.

30
00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:23.353
"So far dinner includes grains, vegetables, dairy, and protein.

31
00:02:27.095 --> 00:02:30.036
But you said there are five food groups."

32
00:02:35.604 --> 00:02:38.125
Just then Dad came in from the garden.

33
00:02:40.746 --> 00:02:42.586
He had a basket of strawberries.

34
00:02:46.347 --> 00:02:48.928
other group is fruits," Mom said.

35
00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:56.910
having strawberries for dessert."

36
00:02:56.930 --> 00:03:00.531
"Yum!" said Theo.

37
00:03:02.272 --> 00:03:03.092
Mom grinned.

38
00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:08.065
"See? Healthy foods are delicious!"

39
00:03:08.085 --> 00:03:14.656
"I'm still not sure about that salad," Theo said.

40
00:03:14.676 --> 00:03:18.723
"But I will try it!"
